81
00:06:32,975 --> 00:06:34,624
They replied and said;

82
00:06:34,827 --> 00:06:37,047
You are the Messenger of Allah.

83
00:06:37,902 --> 00:06:43,468
He replied; I am Muhammad Bin AbdAllah Bin Abdul Muttalib(محمد بن عبدالله بن عبدالمطلب),  which means son,

84
00:06:43,661 --> 00:06:47,105
 I am Muhammad(محمد), son of Abdallah(عبد الله), son of Abdul Muttalib(عبدالمطلب),

85
00:06:47,537 --> 00:06:52,581
Allah divides the creation and made me part of His best creatures.

86
00:06:53,638 --> 00:06:58,034
