97
00:07:48,194 --> 00:07:52,284
and he granted me eminence from the tribe of Bannu Hashim( بنو هاشم)."

98
00:07:52,961 --> 00:07:57,772
So Rasool Allah ﷺ was the greatest from among Bannu Hashim(بنو هاشم),

99
00:07:58,153 --> 00:08:00,889
